      },
      "note": [
        "The meaning of (..) is that data cannot occur or is removed for reasons of confidentiality. The figure zero (0) means that the value has been rounded down to zero, or is zero.",
        "The statistics are based on information that collection schemes, producer responsibility organisations and producers have reported to the Swedish Environmental Protection Agency. There may be minor errors in the data. The Swedish Environmental Protection Agency reviews the reported data continuously and can if necessary make adjustments in the published statistics.",
        "The type of treatments 'Reused without pretreatment' and 'Reused after pretreatment' are reported until 2019. As of 2020, the treatment type 'Prepared for reuse' is reported instead. The type of treatment 'Energy recovery' is reported until 2019. As of 2020 'Other recovery' is reported instead.",
        "The treatment type 'exported from Sweden' is a category calculated by the statistic-producer. It should be understood as “exported – treatment unknow”. For the reference year 2023 and 2024 the statistic producer has chosen to remove 'exported from Sweden' from the underlying data to avoid some issues with statistical confidentiality. These are extremely small quantities. See the quality-report 2023-2024 (in Swedish) for more details. ",
        "To avoid some issues with statistical confidentiality for the reference year 2024, the statistic producer has chosen to reclassify “solar panels that are not consumer-WEEE” to “solar panels that are consumer-WEEE”. This reclassification does not affect other operations (sold and treated amount). These are relatively small quantities. See the quality-report 2023-2024 (in Swedish) for more details."
